# Shy paddles: Solder Bridge between U31 pin 10 (3B, RPADV) and pin 11 (3A, LPADV); 0 wins, so a
# paddle is lit only on the lines both paddles share.
machine tennis
title "Shy paddles"
brief "The paddles only show where they are level with each other. Turn the knobs apart and they shrink, then vanish."
fault bridge U31.10 U31.11
